From 0c8562fe1553ff0c5c406f7075f5676d69dce9e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gavin John <gavinnjohn@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:53:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 082/100] demux: ps: treat a title or seekpoint change as the
 seek it is

DEMUX_SET_TITLE and DEMUX_SET_SEEKPOINT handed the query straight to the
stream, where DEMUX_SET_POSITION two cases above clears the dates it has
accumulated and tells the tracks their data is not continuous. So a chapter
jump left i_current_pts reporting a time from before it, i_scr and i_last_pcr
anchored where the stream used to be - i_last_dts only ever moves forward, so
a backward jump leaves the end pcr beyond the data - and the tracks never
told anything happened, until CheckPCR() noticed the scr had moved by more
than a second and said so a packet late.

Do what the position path does. Reachable through vdr.c, whose seekpoints are
byte offsets inside one recording, and through vcd.c.

Compiled and smoke tested on a synthetic VDR recording carrying an MPEG
program stream: both cut marks reached, playback continuous, one decoder
start for the run. The ts side of the same fault is measurable and was;
this one has no log line of its own to count.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 modules/demux/mpeg/ps.c | 21 +++++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/modules/demux/mpeg/ps.c b/modules/demux/mpeg/ps.c
index c6121ff446..b746f8661c 100644
--- a/modules/demux/mpeg/ps.c
+++ b/modules/demux/mpeg/ps.c
@@ -837,11 +837,24 @@ static int Control( demux_t *p_demux, int i_query, va_list args )
         }
 
         case DEMUX_SET_TITLE:
-            return vlc_stream_vaControl( p_demux->s, STREAM_SET_TITLE, args );
-
         case DEMUX_SET_SEEKPOINT:
-            return vlc_stream_vaControl( p_demux->s, STREAM_SET_SEEKPOINT,
-                                         args );
+            /* The stream repositions itself, which is as much a seek as
+             * DEMUX_SET_POSITION is, so leave behind what that leaves behind:
+             * no dates carried over from where the stream used to be, and the
+             * tracks told their data is not continuous. */
+            i_ret = vlc_stream_vaControl( p_demux->s,
+                                          (i_query == DEMUX_SET_TITLE)
+                                              ? STREAM_SET_TITLE
+                                              : STREAM_SET_SEEKPOINT, args );
+            if( i_ret == VLC_SUCCESS )
+            {
+                p_sys->i_current_pts = 0;
+                p_sys->i_scr = -1;
+                p_sys->i_last_dts = VLC_TICK_INVALID;
+                p_sys->i_last_pcr = VLC_TICK_INVALID;
+                NotifyDiscontinuity( p_sys->tk, p_demux->out );
+            }
+            return i_ret;
 
         case DEMUX_GET_META:
             return vlc_stream_vaControl( p_demux->s, STREAM_GET_META, args );
